      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY TROJAN (7) settled back from out wide but wound up hard into the minor money, finishing 0.8 lengths from the winner (22.75) at Maitland in Mix 2/3. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Top chance in this line up. FABULOUS FLAME (1) was in the money (18.02) last time out at Taree Super Track after taking advantage of the inside draw. Missed the frame only look here. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Winning chance. MISS ZIVA (2) had been in super honest form hitting the frame three times on end before finishing seventh (18.47) at Taree Super Track last time. Solid record at the distance winning six races. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. GAMBINO (3) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
